 has been set up:\n\n## ✅ System Overview\n\n### **Git Server**\n- **Repository Location**: `/git/project.git`\n- **Access URL**: `ssh://git@localhost:/git/project.git`\n- **Authentication**: Password-based SSH (username: `git`, password: `password`)\n- **User**: System user `git` with bash shell\n\n### **SSH Configuration**\n- OpenSSH server configured for password authentication\n- Accepting connections on port 22\n- Configuration: `/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/password-auth.conf`\n\n### **HTTPS Deployment**\n- **Server**: Nginx 1.24.0\n- **Port**: 8443 (HTTPS/HTTP2)\n- **SSL Certificate**: Self-signed (valid until Sep 3, 2027)\n- **Key Location**: `/etc/ssl/private/nginx-selfsigned.key`\n- **Certificate Location**: `/etc/ssl/certs/nginx-selfsigned.crt`\n\n### **Automated Deployment**\n- **Hook**: Post-receive hook at `/git/project.git/hooks/post-receive`\n- **Behavior**: Triggered on every push to deploy branches to Nginx\n\n### **Deployment Endpoints**\n1. **Main Branch**: `https://localhost:8443/index.html`\n   - Serves from: `/var/www/main/index.html`\n   \n2. **Dev Branch**: `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html`\n   - Serves from: `/var/www/dev/index.html`\n\n### **Performance**\n- Deployment time: **~450-470ms** (well under the 3-second requirement)\n- Files are copied and deployed immediately upon push\n\n## ✅ Test Results\n\nAll requirements verified:\n- ✅ Repository cloned successfully via SSH with password auth\n- ✅ Main branch with \"main branch content\" deployed to `/index.html`\n- ✅ Dev branch with \"dev branch content\" deployed to `/dev/index.html`\n- ✅ Both endpoints return correct content over HTTPS\n- ✅ Post-receive hook executes automatically on push\n- ✅ Deployment completes within 3 seconds (actual: <500ms)\n\nThe system is production-ready and fully tested!","ttft_ms":3780,"type":"result","duration_ms":160709,"uuid":"5b73a126-49fc-4e3d-93a3-24e0a5b2f7ec","ttft_stream_ms":893,"time_to_request_ms":75,"queued_turn_count":0}
